西薩搭搭路（shisa-reunion）

這個 repo 公開只供查看。除了下方列出的第三方素材，本作的程式碼、美術、角色、關卡設計、
文字與原創樂曲都保留所有權利；未經書面同意，不得使用、重製、修改、散布或用於商業用途。

This repository is public for viewing only. Except for the third-party materials
listed below, all code, artwork, characters, level design, text and original music
are the property of the copyright holder. No permission is granted to use, copy,
modify, distribute or commercially exploit them without prior written consent.


第三方素材 / Third-party materials

下列素材依各自的授權，不受上面「保留所有權利」的限制。
The materials below stay under their own licenses and are not covered by the
reservation above.

- 明信片照片 Postcard photos: public/places/*.webp
  Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 2.0 / 2.5 / 4.0 or public domain. Authors, sources and
  changes are listed in README.md, src/content/photos.json and the in-game photo
  credits page.

- 字型 Fonts: public/fonts/
  GenSen Rounded TW (源泉圓體, subset) and Fredoka (@fontsource/fredoka), under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. Full texts: public/fonts/GenSenRounded-OFL.txt and
  public/fonts/Fredoka-OFL.txt.

- 傳統民謠旋律 Traditional melodies
  Traditional Okinawan songs whose melodies are in the public domain (titles and
  sources in README.md). Only the melodies are used; lyrics, arrangements and
  recordings by others are not.

- npm 套件 npm packages
  react, react-dom, zustand, immer, workbox and others, each under its own license
  (mostly MIT), found in the package's LICENSE file.
